## Progress (2026-10-29)

Implementation `0a737f66`, checked with current main in `50caca7e`: **99 tests**, zero failures/ignored; four portable release builds; all standard CLI cycles, including a new export/check and exact bundle regeneration. Independent PyTorch regenerated the original six model fixtures unchanged. [Evidence](../nrl/reports/native-conformance-2026-10-29.json), [raw log](../nrl/reports/native-conformance-check-2026-10-29.txt), [16 scenario results](../nrl/reports/native-conformance-cases-2026-10-29.json). Source was built on the NRL branch and merged into fast-test before this affected-check run; no fast-test build/test was used as evidence. Native acceptance is unchanged. APP/KRN handoff was subsequently delivered; see Resolution below.

## Resolution

Implemented the unchanged MIT full-graph model bundle and offline make/check commands, independent PyTorch-derived f64 payloads/tolerance, SHA-bound inventory, pinned float/typed-object encoding vectors and 16 deterministic runtime scenarios. The format profile names a writer subset without weakening the existing host reader or claiming a native parser. Work preflight/cumulative charges, partial interruption, output/workspace clearing, terminal poisoning, independent sessions and deadline mapping are explicit. All **99 host tests**, four portable release builds and standard CLI cycles pass on `50caca7e`; independent PyTorch regeneration matches exactly. Evidence is linked above.

The checked handoff/evidence is published as `9cb4c346d284747f1c1dd10fe70d97ce986f5477`. APP received the text/f64 agreement, exact model ID/source/fixture commit/tolerance, design corrections and parser/lifetime ownership questions in [APP/2026-10-29T1459Z-NRL-text-f64-agreed-pinned-native-conformance-package.md](https://github.com/NikolayUvarov/gcu_undocumented_func/blob/internal-dev-messages/APP/2026-10-29T1459Z-NRL-text-f64-agreed-pinned-native-conformance-package.md) (`eaa3fc09`). KRN received the boot-prerequisite/lifetime notice in [KRN/2026-10-29T1459Z-NRL-nnd-format-agreement-and-client-identity-lifetime.md](https://github.com/NikolayUvarov/gcu_undocumented_func/blob/internal-dev-messages/KRN/2026-10-29T1459Z-NRL-nnd-format-agreement-and-client-identity-lifetime.md) (`93568a17`). Both messages are pushed on internal-dev-messages, one per commit. The binding request is in [requests-APP.md](../issues/requests-APP.md#nrl-native-nnd-integration-for-900-t11).

This task closes the NRL host acceptance-input/handoff work only. [900-NRL-0017](../issues/900-NRL-0017-native-runtime-and-nnd-integration.md) remains open for APP's service/parser/IDL, KRN's grants and named-target native budget/cancellation/isolation/failure/lifecycle evidence. No native acceptance or OS profile guarantee was added. The full repository gate remains the landing integrator's work.
